WEBVTT

00:45:30.010 --> 00:45:32.353
I can never support
the current Republican Party.

00:45:32.377 --> 00:45:34.506
So what do I do? I don't know.

00:45:34.530 --> 00:45:37.792
There's that Starbucks guy,
but I'm not sure he has an idea, either.

00:45:37.816 --> 00:45:38.879
(Laughs)

00:45:38.903 --> 00:45:43.902
CA: But that must be
profoundly depressing, though. Right?

00:45:43.926 --> 00:45:50.132
That doesn't sound like you see
a particular way forward for someone,

00:45:50.156 --> 00:45:51.781
let alone a party,

00:45:51.805 --> 00:45:53.919
who can actually execute and do something.

00:45:53.943 --> 00:45:57.513
Unless it's a centrist Democrat?
Then you're feeling happier?

00:45:57.537 --> 00:45:59.580
DB: Yeah, but because I'm conservative,

00:45:59.604 --> 00:46:02.146
I believe "... of all the things
human hearts endure,